# "Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a permanent card, put a +1/+1 counter on this permanent." Bot2's Wheel of
# Fortune on turn 2 sends both hands to the graveyards. On turn 3 Lion Sash exiles Bot2's Lightning Bolt (instant) and
# Demonic Tutor (sorcery), no counter for either, and its Island (a land card: a counter). On turn 5 it exiles Bot1's
# Conclave Tribunal (enchantment), Liliana of the Veil (planeswalker), Invasion of Gobakhan (battle) and Llanowar Elves
# (creature): a counter each. Five counters in all.

